  id: tutorial.turn_and_brake
  title: Turn and Brake
  description: Single-ski pressure steers your skis. Both ski inputs together become
    one of your main braking tools.
  autoAccept: 0
  tutorialQuest: 1
  stages:
  - id: tutorial.turn_and_brake.stage1
    title: One Pair of Inputs, Three Uses
    description: Use single-ski pressure to carve, both skis together to wedge, and
      backward lean plus a hard turn to stop quickly.
    objectives:
    - id: tutorial.turn_and_brake.turn
      title: Carve across the slope
      description: Apply single-ski pressure while moving to arc across the slope
        and feel the edge bite.
